{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/logolong.png?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super One More Jump is an intense arcade platformer with a simple twist\u2014it's just one button! Easy-to-learn, impossible to put down, and even harder to master. Just-one-more jump your way through handcrafted, gravity-defying levels that ramp up in complexity and creative mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_steam_store_divider_gameplay.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Including a huge selection of challenge levels, high score chasing modes and a select few impossible challenges to master. Further test your skill with gameplay remix modifiers that give levels an extra challenging twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_store_page_3.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_store_page_circuit_1.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_steam_store_divider_multiplayer.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four players, one button each. Can you work together to beat the 80 co-op challenges?\u00a0<i>(Supports 2-4 local players)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your friends with the included local split screen endless mode. (<i>Supports 2 local players)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_store_page_coop_1.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_steam_store_divider_collabs.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guest pixel artists from some of our favourite indie games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/premo_somj_artists_test_1.png?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your mood with the included soundtracks:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New music soundtrack featuring 18 tracks by Space Bwoi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original music soundtrack by Batterie</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_store_page_4.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_steam_store_divider_workshop.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access to community created levels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access to community created custom pixel themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Included level editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_workshop_2.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Features</u></strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">150+ Hand crafted levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge modes for each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Circuit mode\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2-4 player local co-op mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 player local competitive mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New music soundtrack by Space Bwoi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original music soundtrack by Batterie</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customise your game with easily unlockable themes and avatars from some of our favorite pixel artists: Toby Dixon (@tbdxn), Ilija Melentijevic (@iLkKke), Cocefi (@chickysprout), Sven 'ptoing' Ruthner (@the_ptoing), Mister Hk (@mr_hk_), Stephane Boutin (@JGSBoutain), Helm (@helm_ll), Anders Gullmarsvik (@itchabop), Ian Cid (@skydevilpalm)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Workshop support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Included level editor</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556830?t=1745136389","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/ec9ebb34f88effce514379f933ccc08e660c244c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745136389","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/e7a11b4b503e186a11ef1d9fdd2f9e49225bbe20/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745136389","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/e7a11b4b503e186a11ef1d9fdd2f9e49225bbe20/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745136389","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/logolong.png?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super One More Jump is an intense arcade platformer with a simple twist\u2014it's just one button! Easy-to-learn, impossible to put down, and even harder to master. Just-one-more jump your way through handcrafted, gravity-defying levels that ramp up in complexity and creative mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_steam_store_divider_gameplay.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Including a huge selection of challenge levels, high score chasing modes and a select few impossible challenges to master. Further test your skill with gameplay remix modifiers that give levels an extra challenging twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_store_page_3.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_store_page_circuit_1.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_steam_store_divider_multiplayer.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four players, one button each. Can you work together to beat the 80 co-op challenges?\u00a0<i>(Supports 2-4 local players)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your friends with the included local split screen endless mode. (<i>Supports 2 local players)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_store_page_coop_1.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_steam_store_divider_collabs.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guest pixel artists from some of our favourite indie games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/premo_somj_artists_test_1.png?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your mood with the included soundtracks:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New music soundtrack featuring 18 tracks by Space Bwoi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original music soundtrack by Batterie</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_store_page_4.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_steam_store_divider_workshop.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access to community created levels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access to community created custom pixel themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Included level editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/somj_workshop_2.gif?t=1745136389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Features</u></strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">150+ Hand crafted levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge modes for each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Circuit mode\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2-4 player local co-op mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 player local competitive mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New music soundtrack by Space Bwoi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original music soundtrack by Batterie</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customise your game with easily unlockable themes and avatars from some of our favorite pixel artists: Toby Dixon (@tbdxn), Ilija Melentijevic (@iLkKke), Cocefi (@chickysprout), Sven 'ptoing' Ruthner (@the_ptoing), Mister Hk (@mr_hk_), Stephane Boutin (@JGSBoutain), Helm (@helm_ll), Anders Gullmarsvik (@itchabop), Ian Cid (@skydevilpalm)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Workshop support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Included level editor</p></li></ul>","developers":["PREMO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/header.jpg?t=1745136389","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.15.0+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5Ghz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257102186,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257102186/movie480.mp4?t=1743647279","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257102186/movie_max.mp4?t=1743647279"},"name":"Steam Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257102186/8846673af4e4cb1a5776c9a5a821abe7acd731be/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743647279","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257102186/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743647279","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257102186/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743647279"}}],"name":"Super One More Jump","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo E8400 or AMD Phenom II X2 550<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD 630 or Radeon Vega 8<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["PREMO"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cSuper One More Jump absolutely nails its platforming mechanics that when combined with the huge variety in the obstacles you must overcome, creates an experience that\u2019s incredibly enjoyable, rewarding, and tough as nails.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 Nintendo Life<br><br>\u201cSuper One More Jump has a lot to love. It is incredibly addicting with tons of levels to get through. My struggle to get every blue gem became an obsession and 100%-ing it all takes time and effort. Add to that the additional modes and graphical styles, and you have something that feels very full and complete.\u201d<br>8.5/10 \u2013 Nintendo World Report<br><br>\u201cSuper One More Jump is a fun and addicting game that\u2019s simple to pick up and has a gradual difficulty curve.  With over 100 levels to play and a few extra game modes to unlock, plus the two multiplayer options including two player co-op, Super One More Jump is definitely worth picking up.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Gaming Nexus<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/d20c294789db814dea3b2a4da2758c9dd5683b6f/ss_d20c294789db814dea3b2a4da2758c9dd5683b6f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745136389","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/d20c294789db814dea3b2a4da2758c9dd5683b6f/ss_d20c294789db814dea3b2a4da2758c9dd5683b6f.600x338.jpg?t=1745136389"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/467dd5edb37c7ba47f0d36b13b9f087dc64b0af2/ss_467dd5edb37c7ba47f0d36b13b9f087dc64b0af2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745136389","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/467dd5edb37c7ba47f0d36b13b9f087dc64b0af2/ss_467dd5edb37c7ba47f0d36b13b9f087dc64b0af2.600x338.jpg?t=1745136389"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap